'''Celestic Town Elder''' (Japanese: '''カンナギタウンの長老''' ''Kannagi Town Elder'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Put 1 random Basic Pokémon from your discard pile into your hand.
}}

