==Trivia==
* {{TCGP|Fishing Net}} has a similar effect, but is an {{TCGP|Item card}} instead of a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} and can only add Basic {{e|Water}} Pokémon.
* This card's effect is similar to {{TCG|Pokémon Rescue}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this card is a Supporter card rather than an Item card, and this card can only add a Basic Pokémon chosen at random (rather than a specifically chosen Pokémon of any [[Evolution]] stage).

===Origin===
*The [[Celestic Town]] Elder is the [[Cynthia's grandmother|grandmother]] of [[Cynthia]], [[Champion]] of the [[Sinnoh League]].

